   - Roentgenium was synthesized in Germany.
   - Modicus is a Portuguese futsal team, so Portugal governs former colonial holdings relevant to that entity.
   - Aruba is geographically in the Caribbean on the North American continent.
   - Oleg Bogayev’s country is Russia; Nicholas II was Tsar during WWI and was removed in the 1917 Russian Revolution, leading to the Soviet Union’s creation.
